--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version:  2.16.0.9 (dev), git-rev 6ac010af0e9f1caebc06c1941b84f1904204cad6
License:  BSD-3-Clause
Source:   https://sourceforge.net/projects/zint/
Location: barcode/zint/third_party/zint (vendored)
Full text: barcode/zint/third_party/zint/LICENSE

Copyright (C) Robin Stuart and contributors.

Only the BSD-licensed backend is vendored and built. Zint's frontends and its
Qt backend remain under the GPL and are deliberately absent from this
repository; the build additionally sets ZINT_FRONTEND=OFF and ZINT_USE_QT=OFF.
This distinction is what allows this project to be distributed under the
Apache License. Do not vendor the Zint frontend or Qt sources without
revisiting the licensing of the whole project.

