Radamsa
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version:  0.7, git-rev 40d5dec416fb5277dbbd72c04b82ba2ae039778a
License:  MIT
Source:   https://gitlab.com/akihe/radamsa
Location: barcode/radamsa/third_party/radamsa (vendored, generated C form)
Full text: barcode/radamsa/third_party/radamsa/LICENCE

Copyright (c) 2013 Aki Helin and contributors.

Used by the fuzzing feature to mutate payloads. The vendored libradamsa.c is
generated from radamsa's Scheme sources by the Owl Lisp compiler (an offline,
one-time step; see PINNED_VERSION.txt and tools/regenerate-radamsa.sh), then
compiled from plain C by the NDK. The Owl Lisp toolchain is not required to build
the app. The bundled "hex" library used during generation
(https://gitlab.com/owl-lisp/hex) is likewise MIT-licensed.

